From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 23:10:51 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove web_search_providers crate
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The only registered provider was CloudWebSearchProvider, which gated on
model.is_provided_by_zed() — never true after the cloud LLM provider was
deregistered in patch 0009. Drop the init calls + crate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
